{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":7,"ref":"isaiah 44:7","book":"isaiah","lang":"id","chapter":44,"translation":"Dan siapakah seperti aku? ⟨Biarkan ia⟩ berseru, dan memberitahukannya, dan menyusunnya ⟨menjadi urutan⟩ bagiku, sejak aku menetapkan umat dari masa purbakala? Dan hal-hal yang akan datang, dan apa yang akan terjadi — biarkan mereka memberitahukannya kepada mereka.","tokens":[{"surface":"ומי","gloss":"Dan siapakah"},{"surface":"כמוני","gloss":"seperti aku"},{"surface":"יקרא","gloss":"⟨biarkan ia⟩ berseru"},{"surface":"ויגידה","gloss":"dan memberitahukannya"},{"surface":"ויערכה","gloss":"dan menyusunnya"},{"surface":"לי","gloss":"bagiku"},{"surface":"משומי","gloss":"sejak aku menetapkan"},{"surface":"עם","gloss":"umat"},{"surface":"עולם","gloss":"dari masa purbakala"},{"surface":"ואתיות","gloss":"dan hal-hal yang akan datang"},{"surface":"ואשר","gloss":"dan apa yang"},{"surface":"תבאנה","gloss":"akan terjadi"},{"surface":"יגידו","gloss":"biarkan mereka memberitahukannya"},{"surface":"למו","gloss":"kepada mereka"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-08T11:13:08.858703258Z","model":"glm-5.2"}